### 53. CROSS-DAY EVIDENCE - AUGUST 19 THROUGH AUGUST 25
###
### THIS IS NOW THE PRIMARY MULTI-DAY LEARNING REQUEST.
###
### THE CONTROLLER AUTOMATICALLY EXCLUDES:
###
### SATURDAY AUGUST 22
### SUNDAY AUGUST 23
###
### INCLUDED:
###
### AUGUST 19
### AUGUST 20
### AUGUST 21
### AUGUST 24
### AUGUST 25
###
### EACH DAY IS ANALYZED INDEPENDENTLY.
###
### IDENTICAL RULE DEFINITIONS ARE THEN MATCHED ACROSS DAYS.
###
### CURRENT CROSS-DAY PROMOTION GATES:
###
### >= 3 observed trading days
###
### >= 20 independent FVGs
###
### >= 60% positive days
###
### >= +0.10R aggregate expectancy
###
### >= 1.25 profit factor
###
### POSSIBLE CLASSIFICATIONS:
###
### PersistentCandidate
### Watchlist
### Unstable
### PersistentNegative
### InsufficientEvidence
###
### IMPORTANT:
###
### PersistentCandidate DOES NOT mean live activation.
###
### PersistentCandidate
### ->
### FrozenOutOfSampleValidation
### ->
### Sandbox
### ->
### Promotion Review
###
### top=10 returns the 10 strongest rules in each major category.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

POST {{PFA_FVG_Scanner_HostAddress}}/api/CrossDayEvidence/MESU6?startUtc=2026-08-19T00:00:00Z&endUtc=2026-08-25T23:59:00Z&top=10
Accept: application/json


